    "description": "Complete test collection for Favourite Tours and Tour Bookings features.\n\nWorkflow:\n1. Add Favourite → Check Favourite → List Favourites → Remove Favourite\n2. Create Booking → Get Booking → List Bookings → Cancel Booking\n\nBase URL: http://localhost:5183",
